# RESETIUS |   x=>5F[-X][+X]>5@0.75F[-X][+X]>5@0.75F[-X][+X]
# RESETIUS |   x=<5@0.75F[-X][+X]<5@0.75F[-X][+X]<5@0.75F[X]
